    "text": "news3lv.com\nwebsite\nLas Vegas\nSummerlin South falls to Metro 7-3, in LLWS\nBy News 3 Staff,\n15 hours agoLAS VEGAS (KSNV) — Summerlin South took the field on Wednesday for a shot at playing for the national title. The Summerlin South All-Stars faced Metro Region champion Fairfield National (Connecticut) in the 2025 Little League World Series. The team lost to Metro, 7-3. Metro will advance to play...\n12",
